haps be matt murdock aka  daredevil and the watch could prove that  matt murdock is daredevil which is why  it needs to not fall in the hands of the  wrong people and perhaps clint knows  matt because maybe he helped him out  with some legal stuff after all after  captain america civil war they told us  that clint and scott took plea deals  which means that someone came in and  intervened for them most likely  everyone's entitled to a lawyer so  perhaps that lawyer could have been matt  murdock since matt murdock is rumored to  be in the echo series it would make  sense if he came into this series not to  mention kingpin and echo are directly  related to daredevil so it could be mats  and his daredevil identity could be at  risk here if somebody finds that watch  and if kingpin is behind the tracksuit  mafia which we all believe he is it  would make sense if he believes that  watch belongs to daredevil and could  prove that matt is him or believes it  belongs to matt and could prove that  he's daredevil and my last option would  be kingpin but hawkeye says it belongs  to a friend so i don't believe it could  be kingpin i know a lot of people think  it could be which is why the tracksuit  mafia is trying to get it but i really  doubt it's kingpin's watch so my two  best guesses are it's matt murdock's or  clint's wife has somewhat of a past and  could belong to her now clint actually  went through a lot emotionally in this  episode he revealed to kate that he is  indeed ronan and he did a lot of things  as ronan of course he did this because  his entire family got dusted in the snap  and he kind of starts to relive some  things we see the beginning opening  footage for avengers in-game where  clinton is on his property and he's  teaching his daughter lila how to shoot  a bow laura is making lunch and then of  course they all got snapped and in his  head he hears natasha in the background  saying killing all those people isn't  going to bring your family back which is  what she tells him during avengers in  game we then see new footage of him as  ronin as he relives some parts of his  past as ronan inside of his head we see  him killing a few people which is  obviously haunting him then of course we  see the part of avengers inning game  where natasha sacrifices herself so  clint can get the soul stone which  obviously has been haunting him as well  now clint the next day sends kate on a  mission to go see the larpers the reason  is because the police station has most  of his trick arrows he needs them back  and most of the larpers that he fought  around during the event including grylls  are nypd and firefighters so he needs  kate to get the officers to go to the  precinct and get the arrows so that's  her task and his task is to go and talk  to qazi one of the biggest things that  concerns hawkeye right now is that kate  is in danger because maya thinks that  she's ronan so she's in danger and even  if kate wasn't in danger clint can't  have everybody thinking that the ronin  is still around because that's bad news  for him so he goes to kazi and  essentially tells him hey convince maya  that ronan is gone he's dead and if you  recall in the last episode he actually  said that natasha black widow killed the  ronin now maya didn't believe him and  she actually attacked kate in which kazi  thought was a little overboard which is  why clint is going to kazi he says that  you're a reasonably not stupid person  and he has maya's ear so he tells him to  get the job done convince maya that  ronan is gone and she's chasing a ghost  then hawkeye and kate attempt to break  into an apartment where they have  tracked the location of the rolex  hawkeye has a smart thought out plan but  of course kate kind of goes off the  bandwagon and does things her own way  this puts her inside of the apartment  while clint is on the lookout kate ends  up getting into the apartment where she  immediately sees some lights that are  flashing like strobe lights now she  covers them quickly with putty arrows  and eventually goes on to find the watch  and after she finds the watch she finds  a piece of paper that has information  about clint's family including the name  of his wife and all of their kids so  somebody is tracking down hawkeye and  learning about his family and we quickly  discover that that person is maya clint  quickly realizes that those flashing  strobe lights were sensors for deaf  people the alarms flash for deaf people  since they obviously cannot hear an  alarm now here's where things get really  really good clint thinks that he's  fighting maya on the rooftop and of  course maya comes into the apartment and  hits kate which confuses her because she  says she's fighting maya but clint also  says that he is fighting maya but kate  says no she's here in the apartment and  clinton goes well who the hell am i  fighting a mysterious figure emerges out  of nowhere and fights clint and the  second we see a black widow bite come  off of her wrist we know exactly who it  is it is yelena balova if you've seen  the black widow movie you know exactly  who this is if you haven't seen the  movie it's natasha romanov's sister and  in the post-credits scene of black widow  spoilers incoming we see elena at  natasha's grave when val all of a sudden  comes up to her now we saw val in the  falcon and the winter soldier she  recruited us agent john walker for a  team that hasn't really been revealed  yet but we believe to be the  thunderbolts or the dark avengers and in  the post-credits scene it was very  obvious that she recruited yelena bulova  to work for her and in the scene she  delivers elena's next assignment and she  says that her next assignment is to go  after the person that killed her sister  natasha and then she showed her a  picture of hawkeye so val told yelena  that clint actually killed natasha now  obviously this is a lie but yelena  doesn't know anything else so she kind  of just trusts her employer so this is  why elena shows up out of nowhere and  attacks clint now meanwhile maya and  kate are still fighting but all of them  end up on the same rooftop together in  some scenes that are pretty freaking  awesome all of a sudden we kind of see  everyone fighting maya elena clinton  kate and it's an epic scene until  eventually kate shows up hits everybody  with a sonic arrow in which maya kicks  her clear across the rooftop but then  kate shoots her in the shoulder with an  arrow this causes maya to retreat and  clint is left to deal with yelena in  which she does take her mask off and it  is officially revealed to be yelena  bulova now it looks like she probably  could have taken out clint she hits him  with a widow bite and he kind of goes  down but then kate is looking at her  with a bow pulled back ready to fire an  arrow at her now yelena kind of shakes  her head no and kate does put the arrow  down this causes yolena to make an  escape however i do believe that yelena  could have taken both of them so it  leads me to believe that yelena actually  saw clint taking care of kate and  believes that maybe he's not such a bad  person and could make her question  things now this is where things get  really intense hawkeye recognizes that  that was a black widow and maybe he does  even know who yolina belova is i  wouldn't be surprised considering how  close him and that were and i would  assume yelena knows who hawkeye is  because one he was an avenger and he  fought beside natasha and probably knew  they were at least somewhat friends and  that's enough to put a little bit of  doubt in her mind about whether or not  hawkeye actually did kill her but the  fact that a black widow showed up makes  hawkeye realize how serious this  situation is now a black widow assassin  is now involved in the picture and he  knows because of his experience with  them and natasha that they are some of  the deadliest killers on the planet and  this severely puts kate in jeopardy  